    <briefdescription>
<para>END document window — <ref refid="classjam_1_1_window" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::Window</ref> + resize tracking. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Inherits the full glassmorphism, GL renderer, and native-context API from <ref refid="classjam_1_1_window" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::Window</ref>. Adds resizeStart/resizeEnd overrides that set the <computeroutput><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_window_1a2e6bd97e1780418e11d8e10536f906dd" kindref="member">userResizing</ref></computeroutput> flag, queryable via <ref refid="classterminal_1_1_window_1a711beca87b418d467359a09574b8f8d2" kindref="member">isUserResizing()</ref>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>MESSAGE THREAD — all methods called on the JUCE message thread. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classjam_1_1_window" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::Window</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
